<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian currency reserves up 1.15 pct in Oct.</title>
<headline>Austrian currency reserves up 1.15 pct in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian foreign currency reserves rose 1.15 percent to 192.5 billion schillings in October, the National Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    AUSTRIAN RESERVES	    Oct 1996	  Sept 1996</p>
<p>    Reserves (bln ATS)	   192.505	    190.313</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
</text>
